==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/r̥eitn/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|eitn|lang=is}}
*: Homophones: {{l|is|Hreinn}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{der|is|non|hreinn}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*hrainiz}}.

====Adjective====
{{is-adj|hreinni|hreinastur}}

# [[clean]]
# [[pure]]
# {{lb|is|slang}} [[virgin]]
#: ''[[vera|Ertu]] [[ennþá]] '''hreinn'''?''
#:: [[be|Are]] [[you]] [[still]] a '''virgin'''? (referring to a man)
#: ''[[vera|Ertu]] [[ennþá]] '''hrein'''?''
#:: [[be|Are]] [[you]] [[still]] a '''virgin'''? (referring to a woman)

